{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088000/extras/9730be171ccf704f7c12b17b04a3506a.poster.avif?t=1766471051\" width=516 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088000/extras/9730be171ccf704f7c12b17b04a3506a.webm?t=1766471051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088000/extras/9730be171ccf704f7c12b17b04a3506a.mp4?t=1766471051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurdus</strong> (from Latin absurdus, &quot;discordant, ridiculous&quot;; from Latin. ad absurdum, &quot;coming from a deaf person&quot;), absurdity, meaninglessness \u2014 the absence of meaning, sense, reason in whom, in what, something illogical, ridiculous, contrary to common sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But have you ever immersed yourself in a real atmosphere of the absurd - full of nonsense, illogical situations and crazy twists?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMOLOGY: Absurd Racing</strong> is not just a big name, it's real madness! Immerse yourself in the world of senseless and explosive races with AI rivals that will completely change your understanding of this game genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is waiting for you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 meme characters with unique and unpredictable characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 locations with different difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game modes \u2014 single and for friends (split screen)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localization into 22 languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure madness, madness and ABSURDITY</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold on to the steering wheel and hold your head tight \u2014 &quot;Absurd racing&quot; can drive you crazy. Good luck!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Circle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4088000/e4411f002d94a250646666ec6504348e3f3a2aec.jpg"},{"name":"Lake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4088000/dbd28ac83f46a91d9ddfb8ff0f00c8fb293c0f8c.jpg"},{"name":"Eight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4088000/5d0579dd854f4a7974113d443377ff7917b237ac.jpg"},{"name":"Bridge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4088000/127b9f68c071e5b6b85667563035df9fbc4590e5.jpg"},{"name":"River","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4088000/2d116bfbb1674f97855b4d7e49aef28c895b2552.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088000?t=1766471051","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088000?t=1766471051","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088000/cf4faa2753eff123fd049a9a5f9e3bade6ab610f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766471051","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088000/cf4faa2753eff123fd049a9a5f9e3bade6ab610f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766471051","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline post